# The second resolution of Venom Connoisseur's Alliance ability in a turn gives every creature Bot1 controls deathtouch
# until end of turn (CR 702.2b, 611.2c), the Connoisseur and both Elves it has seen enter. Llanowar Elves enter first (the
# Connoisseur alone gains it, the Elves nothing), then Elvish Mystic: the second resolution reaches the Elves already out.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Forest
Venom Connoisseur
Llanowar Elves
Elvish Mystic
Fyndhorn Elves
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

